(Phase 3: Building the Three-Layer "Is This a Real Person" System) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf
13 TL
(What we were trying to do: confirm that a real, live human being is in front of) Tj
T*
(the camera right now, not a photo, a video playing on a screen, or a paused) Tj
T*
(video frame.) Tj
T*
T*
(What we actually built -- three separate, independent layers, so a weakness in) Tj
T*
(one layer does not by itself let a fake through:) Tj
T*
T*
(Layer 1: an already-trained AI model \(built by others, not trained from scratch) Tj
T*
(by us\) that looks at a single photo and judges whether the skin and texture) Tj
T*
(look like a real, living face or a printed/screen fake. Requires no user action.) Tj
T*
T*
(Figure 2, next page, shows all three layers side by side.) Tj
ET
